  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transparency International Zambia Core Support 2024-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Transparency International Zambia Core Support 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r insatsen &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka samh&#xe4;lles integritet, transparens och ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande, vilket i slut&#xe4;ndan leder till en minskning av korruptionsniv&#xe5;erna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the contribution is strengthened societal integrity, transparency and accountability, ultimately leading to reduction in corruption levels.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall Goal: Strengthened societal integrity, transparency and accountability, ultimately leading to reduction in corruption levels.

Strategic Goal 1: Enhanced citizen&apos;s voices, demanding accountability and acting against corruption

Strategic Goal 2: Enhanced governance and integrity culture in the public and business sector

Strategic Goal 3: Enhanced protection and accountability of public resources

Strategic Goal 4: Strengthened transparency and accountability in climate financing, land and environmental governance</narrative>
  </description>
